"LB_DEBIAN_INSTALLER which will result in 'bootstrap' packages not being "
"cached. This configuration is potentially unsafe as the bootstrap packages "
"are re-used when integrating the Debian Installer."
msgstr ""
"Izbrali ste vrednosti od LB_CACHE, LB_CACHE_PACKAGES, LB_CACHE_STAGES in "
"LB_DEBIAN_INSTALLER, kar bo posledično pomenilo, da paketi 'bootstrap' ne "
"bodo predpomnjeni. Ta nastavitev je lahko nevarna, ker bodo paketi začetnega "
"nalagalnega sistema ponovno uporabljeni pri vključevanju namestilnika Debian."

