"incompatible - syslinux only supports FAT filesystems."
msgstr ""
"Izbrali ste vrednosti LB_BOOTLOADER in LB_BINARY_FILESYSTEM, ki sta "
"nezdružljivi - syslinux podpira samo datotečne sisteme FAT."

